    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d181-a5">

                <pb facs="0227" n="167" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg167"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5 in No. 2407.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Hixson and Newell to Mr. Denby</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Suichow</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-23"><hi rendition="#italic">October 23,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Part of report quoted inclosure your No. 97 is willfully misleading; remainder
                    false, as shown by documentary proof. It destroys all faith in pretense of
                    author to deal honestly with matters. Have full records of trial proceeding.
                    Preparing to leave here with British consul in few days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hixson and
                    Newell</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
